OL,3,GNEWSAPub conversation reveals church
OL,4,Aflags' war history
OL,5,
OL,6,FA short film has been created, inspired
OL,7,Fby a small church's Union Flags -
OL,8,Fdating back to peace treaty signings
OL,9,Fafter World War One - after a filmmaker
OL,10,Faccidentally found out about them in a
OL,11,Fpub.
OL,13,FRosie Danagher said she was in the
OL,14,FTower Bank Arms when two locals
OL,15,F"casually" mentioned the wartime flag
OL,16,Fin St Peter's Church, Far Sawrey, in
OL,17,Fthe Lake District.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
