OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPub conversation reveals church
OL,4,Aflags' war history
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith a cast of 10 local actors, she has
OL,7,Fcreated the film "Union Jack" alongside
OL,8,Ffriend and fellow filmmaker Angus
OL,9,FMichie, which will be shown locally on
OL,10,FRemembrance Day at the same pub the
OL,11,Fstory was unearthed.
OL,13,F"I was covered in goosebumps; it was
OL,14,Fmeant to be, we just had to tell this
OL,15,Fstory," she said.
